  {
   "id": "cypress-inheritance-the-beginning-16937@major-2017-01-12",
   "gameId": "cypress-inheritance-the-beginning-16937",
   "displayName": "UPDATE: Cypress Inheritance: GTX 1080 Ti and HTC VIVE Contest!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2017-01-12T23:34:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We want to again say thank you to all the people who have our game, we do appreciate the support and feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We started a contest early this year to help to market the game as is and let everyone know about the complete remake of the game. This is still ongoing and we do expect to have out in the last quarter of 2017.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are completely rebuilding in UE4 for PC and Mac. We will also make available for the HTC VIVE and Oculus as well. Additionally we will have the game available in Simplified Chinese.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We have not had a winner to submit as of today and have decided to extend the contest until March the 17th 2017, also updating the prizes. The concerns about someone having a jump because of having the game longer do not seem to be an issue given the fact no one has completed and submitted with all items.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ANNOUNCING: Cypress Inheritance GTX 1080 Ti and HTC VIVE Contest. We are running a contest to give away a NVIDIA GTX 1080 Ti Graphics Card along with HTC VIVE unit! The contest will run unitl March the 17th 2017.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The first player who is able to collect the items and take the screenshots of the areas that are listed will be the winner of One NVIDIA GTX 1080 Ti Graphics Card and also One HTC VIVE Unit!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "All the items below are required to be collected and the screenshot once collected. (SEE MORE DETAILS BELOW ON THE OFFICIAL RULES)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chp1 (Note: Items will show in wrist device as collected)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "All 5 Assets",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Family history",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Financial Records",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HDD1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HDD2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HDD3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chp1 extra",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Labyrinth Key",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Audio Files",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(Note: Find the secret area that houses the virtual world. Then, locate the Labyrinth Key which will allow you access to the small ground vaults on the surface. Within one of the small ground vaults will be the audio files. )",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chp2 (Note: Items will show in HUD as collected)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "43/43 Codes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7/7 Journals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chp3 (Note: Items will show in wrist device as collected)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4/4 Keys",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "10 Journals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1 Main key at the end",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once you have the above with your screenshots to verify, you additionally need to have taken screen shots of the areas we are referencing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Chapter III Screenshot that is required with the above",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Finish the game and get the screen shots of your HUD or your Wrist Device, having the items as well as taking the screen shots of the areas we are asking for and then be the first to submit. If you have all the items, shots requested, then send your screenshots of the collected items and the screenshots of the referenced screenshots above, and be the first one to submit these, along with leaving a review on Steam, be qualified, and you will be the winner. Send your submission when complete to Cypressinheritance@cypressinheritance.com Click here for official rules",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We are running this promotion to build a larger user base and we also would appreciate reviews and feedback of the game with it being complete at this point. We are still in the process of rebuild and are planning for the relaunch in late 2017!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We again thank you and hope you enjoy Cypress Inheritance: The Beginning.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
